# API surface summary

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/designs | Create concept and tasks in one transaction |
| GET | /api/designs | Search/filter designs |
| GET | /api/designs/{id} | Full design detail |
| PATCH | /api/designs/{id} | Allowed concept updates |
| POST | /api/designs/{id}/images | Upload/register product or component image |
| POST | /api/designs/{id}/tasks/generate | Generate tasks from workflow pattern |
| POST | /api/tasks | Manual task create |
| GET | /api/tasks/my | Current user task list |
| POST | /api/tasks/{id}/start | START event |
| POST | /api/tasks/{id}/hold | HOLD with reason |
| POST | /api/tasks/{id}/resume | RESUME event |
| POST | /api/tasks/{id}/end | END with completion payload |
| POST | /api/workday/close | Close office workday; reject if running task exists |
| POST | /api/corrections | Create correction |
| PATCH | /api/corrections/{id} | Correction progress/closure |
| POST | /api/approvals | Approve/reject stage |
| GET | /api/kpi/employees | Employee KPI dashboard |
| GET | /api/kpi/design-head | Design Head KPI |
| GET | /api/masters/processes | Process/sub-process master |
| GET | /api/workflow-patterns | Workflow pattern definitions |

## Sample payloads

Create design:
```json
{
  "productTypeId": 1,
  "collectionName": "Royal Festive 2026",
  "seasonId": 4,
  "designHeadEmployeeId": 102,
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "conceptNote": "Premium zari + thread concept",
  "processId": 10,
  "subProcessId": 101,
  "assignmentMode": "AUTOMATIC",
  "workflowPatternId": 3,
  "manualTasks": [],
  "componentIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}
```

Task hold:
```json
{ "holdReasonId": 4, "remark": "Waiting for Design Head approval" }
```

Task end:
```json
{
  "completionStatus": "SEND_FOR_CHECKING",
  "outputRemark": "Sketch V2 completed and uploaded",
  "attachmentIds": [8801, 8802],
  "checklist": [{ "itemId": 12, "result": true }, { "itemId": 13, "result": true }]
}
```

## Error handling
| HTTP | Use case | UI behavior |
|---|---|---|
| 400 | Validation error | Field-specific errors |
| 401 | Not authenticated | Redirect/login |
| 403 | No permission | Permission-denied state |
| 404 | Design/task not found | Return to list with message |
| 409 | Invalid state/concurrency, another running task | Refresh task state and explain conflict |
| 413 | File too large | Show configured limit |
| 422 | Business rule failed | Show business reason (e.g. missing approval) |
| 500 | Unexpected server error | Generic message + CorrelationId |

Every server-fault response includes a `CorrelationId`. Never log confidential
file contents or auth tokens.
